OL,3,GNEWSAAll change for Oxfordshire and
OL,4,AWest Berkshire councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FHot on the heels of plans for a new
OL,7,FThames Valley mayor, the government has
OL,8,Fnow approved proposals to scrap a
OL,9,Fnumber of Oxfordshire and Berkshire
OL,10,Fcouncils.
OL,12,FIt means the authority you pay your
OL,13,Fcouncil tax bill to and whose refuse
OL,14,Fcollectors take your rubbish away may
OL,15,Fchange from the one you are currently
OL,16,Fused to.
OL,18,FThe government has said this will save
OL,19,Fmoney and improve services for
OL,20,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
