OL,3,GNEWSAAll change for Oxfordshire and
OL,4,AWest Berkshire councils
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome council shave also welcomed the
OL,7,Fproposed changes, which would see three
OL,8,Fnew unitary authorities created, but
OL,9,Fothers have called the decision "a
OL,10,Fdisaster".
